1:// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
2:// SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 japes98
3://! fwtest: runs a raw image in the vendored emulator and reports what it did
4://! (docs/HARNESS.md is the user's manual; nothing here is visible to the
5://! firmware side except through it).
6:
